    <string name="about_section_project">INDEPENDENT PROJECT</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">TalentForge is an independent, unofficial project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by the game's developer or publisher.</string>
    <string name="about_section_privacy">PRIVACY</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_offline">TalentForge works offline, without an account, ads or analytics. The developer does not collect, receive or share your personal data.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_storage">Your builds — class, talents, game-data version, the name you typed and when they were created, changed and opened — are stored only in the app's private storage on this device.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_backup_android">The app turns off Android backup and transfer of its data to a new device, so Android does not copy your builds into device or cloud backups. Some manufacturers' own transfer tools may work differently; to move builds to another device, share them as codes.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_backup_ios">If your device's backup (iCloud or a computer) is on, it can include the app's data. That backup is kept under its provider's terms; the developer has no access to it.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_sharing">The app writes to the clipboard only when you tap Copy code, reads it only when you tap Paste, and hands a build code to the system share menu only when you tap Share. A code contains no build name and nothing about you.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_permissions">The app works without the internet and does not ask for access to your location, contacts, camera, microphone, files or notifications.</string>
